PTX MP+cp.async.mbarrier.arrive+not-transitive
"As MP+cp.async.mbarrier.arrive: the async arrive orders only the cp.async operations, not P0's earlier store to h (6893). Expected: allowed."
{
g=1;
h=0;
d=0 @cta 0;
b=mbarrier(1) @cta 0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                       ;
 st.weak.global h, 1                     | mbarrier.test_wait.parity.acquire.cta r0, b, 0 ;
 cp.async.ca.shared.global d, g          | ld.weak.global r1, h                           ;
 cp.async.mbarrier.arrive.noinc.shared b |                                                ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
